    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Welcome to Dockside Dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing life simulation set in a peaceful seaside town, build your own dockside restaurant and make your dreams come true. Sail into the sea with your boat and catch various seafood by fishing or diving. Create special dishes from fish sandwiches to octopus meals and satisfy your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Fish, Dive, Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different fishing rods to catch various fish in different areas of the open sea. Buy new boats to travel farther. Dive into unexplored underwater worlds to hunt unique sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Prepare Perfect Dishes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precise cleaning and seasoning methods for each fish to create flawless dishes. Garnish your meals with appetizers and salads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Customize Your Restaurant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to decorate your restaurant and acquire new equipment as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Interact with the Locals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with and befriend the people living in this seaside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Discover the World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventures await in every corner of this world nestled between wild forests and undiscovered underwater realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dockside Dreams is ideal for anyone looking to relax or build their own small restaurant by the sea, combining seafood hunting, cooking, and management mechanics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Welcome to Dockside Dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/2e3789ae27b3c9fec81855d45298bb82.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing life simulation set in a peaceful seaside town, build your own dockside restaurant and make your dreams come true. Sail into the sea with your boat and catch various seafood by fishing or diving. Create special dishes from fish sandwiches to octopus meals and satisfy your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Fish, Dive, Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different fishing rods to catch various fish in different areas of the open sea. Buy new boats to travel farther. Dive into unexplored underwater worlds to hunt unique sea creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/3249ce7482fed6e6e076e724e999f1fb.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Prepare Perfect Dishes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precise cleaning and seasoning methods for each fish to create flawless dishes. Garnish your meals with appetizers and salads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/8f30ec022c406456dfbfb75c01da3070.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/08a0b951d416c5023a9301568463c0e3.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/1a30053ee617f3c4935be72ee1924e4e.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Customize Your Restaurant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to decorate your restaurant and acquire new equipment as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Interact with the Locals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with and befriend the people living in this seaside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Discover the World!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventures await in every corner of this world nestled between wild forests and undiscovered underwater realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.poster.avif?t=1755081765\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.webm?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870930/extras/f042b64381c6cb569da62deb4234afa4.mp4?t=1755081765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dockside Dreams is ideal for anyone looking to relax or build their own small restaurant by the sea, combining seafood hunting, cooking, and management mechanics.</p>",
